### T1 - Cadastro válido (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Ana", "email": "ana@tarefas.com", "password": "123456" }

### T2 - E-mail repetido (409)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Ana", "email": "ana@tarefas.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login (200)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@tarefas.com", "password": "123456" }
### T3 - Senha errada (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@tarefas.com", "password": "errada" }

### GET /auth/me sem token (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### GET /auth/me com token válido (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### GET /auth/me com token adulterado (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}x